{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long x, y, n, i, j, s1, s2;\n\nlong long dist(long long num, long long den) {\n    return llabs(den * x - num * y);\n}\n\nbool better(long long num, long long den) {\n    if (s1 == -1) return true;\n    long long lhs = dist(s1, s2) * den;\n    long long rhs = dist(num, den) * s2;\n    return lhs > rhs;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    scanf(\"%lld%lld%lld\", &x, &y, &n);\n\n    if (y <= n) {\n        long long g = __gcd(x, y);\n        printf(\"%lld/%lld\", x / g, y / g);\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    s1 = -1;\n    s2 = 0;\n\n    for (i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        j = i * x / y;\n        if (llabs(i * x - j * y) > llabs(i * x - (j + 1) * y)) ++j;\n        if (better(j, i)) {\n            s1 = j;\n            s2 = i;\n        }\n    }\n\n    printf(\"%lld/%lld\", s1, s2);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long x, y;\n    \n    static long dist(long num, long den) {\n        return Math.abs(den * x - num * y);\n    }\n    \n    static boolean better(long num, long den, long s1, long s2) {\n        if (s1 == -1) return true;\n        long lhs = dist(s1, s2) * den;\n        long rhs = dist(num, den) * s2;\n        return lhs > rhs;\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        x = sc.nextLong();\n        y = sc.nextLong();\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        \n        if (y <= n) {\n            long g = gcd(x, y);\n            System.out.println((x / g) + \"/\" + (y / g));\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        long s1 = -1;\n        long s2 = 0;\n        \n        for (long i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            long j = i * x / y;\n            if (Math.abs(i * x - j * y) > Math.abs(i * x - (j + 1) * y)) ++j;\n            if (better(j, i, s1, s2)) {\n                s1 = j;\n                s2 = i;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(s1 + \"/\" + s2);\n    }\n    \n    static long gcd(long a, long b) {\n        while (b != 0) {\n            long temp = b;\n            b = a % b;\n            a = temp;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-3.564294e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00012420837, -4.9709037e-05, -9.298281e-06, -0.005784083, -0.08911394, -0.004095857, -1.490105e-05, 0.0, -0.0063275946, -0.0019367049, -0.0019403931, -0.051832363, -1.03711545e-05, -0.0005012686, -6.675698e-06, -1.1920928e-07, -6.751375, -1.3132782, -5.7220295e-06, -0.007923126, -3.1470758e-05, -0.049367152, -5.960463e-07, -1.490105e-05, -2.1457441e-05, 0.0, -1.6689287e-06, -2.2887922e-05, -2.264974e-06, -1.4305105e-06, -0.00039033423, -5.4836123e-06, 0.0, -2.9682673e-05, -3.576278e-07, -2.3841855e-07, -4.7683704e-07, -1.1920928e-07, -1.072883e-06, 0.0, -4.7683704e-07, -2.145765e-06, -5.960463e-07, -0.07889493, -7.748574e-06, -2.6940936e-05, -0.1603814, 